      "text": "Modelos NPU (Hardware Acelerado)",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13.5,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Modelos NPU (Hardware Acelerado)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "84481327",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 555,
      "y": 380,
      "width": 368.87999999999994,
      "height": 135.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#212529",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 37539300,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 83018257,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Detector Facial (RetinaFace - detector.nb):\n   \u2022 Entrada 320x320 RGB, salida bboxes + 5 landmarks\n   \u2022 Tiempo de inferencia NPU: ~22 ms\n2. Alineador Facial:\n   \u2022 Transformaci\u00f3n af\u00edn a 112x112 en RAM\n3. Embedder Facial (ArcFace - w600k_mbf-uint8-v1.nb):\n   \u2022 MobileFaceNet cuantizado a uint8\n   \u2022 Genera embedding 128D normalizado\n   \u2022 Tiempo de inferencia NPU: ~3.5 ms",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10.8,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Detector Facial (RetinaFace - detector.nb):\n   \u2022 Entrada 320x320 RGB, salida bboxes + 5 landmarks\n   \u2022 Tiempo de inferencia NPU: ~22 ms\n2. Alineador Facial:\n   \u2022 Transformaci\u00f3n af\u00edn a 112x112 en RAM\n3. Embedder Facial (ArcFace - w600k_mbf-uint8-v1.nb):\n   \u2022 MobileFaceNet cuantizado a uint8\n   \u2022 Genera embedding 128D normalizado\n   \u2022 Tiempo de inferencia NPU: ~3.5 ms",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
